            "review_title": "Review at Thai Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Toby Sutcliffe\nHermanus, South Africa7 contributions\n0\nLittle gem in Ha Long Bay in Vietnam\nNov 2025 • Couples\nIf we had not read about it on TripAdvisor, I doubt we would have gone there. A little gem with a comprehensive menu and excellent quality of food. Full of locals, so therein lies a lesson. 7 dishes with fantastic flavours and two beers each for the 4 of us, and the total bill was around 750 000 Vietnamese dongs. A must visit if you are in Ha Long Bay.\nWritten November 11, 2025",
