            "review_title": "Review at Thai Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Mi N\n1 contribution\n0\nHIGHLY RECOMMENDED THAI KITCHEN HALONG\nDec 2023 • Friends\nI personally really like the sour, spicy, salty and sweet taste of Thailand. I have also enjoyed many Thai restaurants everywhere and was quite surprised with Thai Kitchen Ha Long because the hot pot and tower of ribs were extremely delicious and different from many other restaurants. I have ever eaten. Beautiful restaurant, polite staff, highly recommended, a place to eat for everyone's reference 😍\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 11, 2024",
